    (priority . 10.0)
    (description . "Record the owner-ratified reset: my-idea is a simple WSM/Tauri IDE with an Open/Edit/Build/Run/Stop/Output loop; Observatory and swarm control belong to tauricode. Preserve old vision as historical, update AGENTS/README/repo.my, define the reuse map and evidence ladder.")
